OL,3,GNEWSAThe woman who has worked for the
OL,4,ANHS since it was founded
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I always said I want to die before I
OL,7,Fstop living. I exist quite a lot for
OL,8,Fthe rest of the week, but today I live,
OL,9,Fbecause I can do this and I know I'm
OL,10,Fappreciated," Audrey told the BBC.
